OL,3,GOrkney & Shetland
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA dry and
OL,6,Fbright evening with light winds. Cloud
OL,7,Fwill thicken across Orkney later, with
OL,8,Frain arriving around midnight
OL,9,Faccompanied by freshening winds.
OL,10,FShetland will remain dry throughout.
OL,11,
OL,12,CTuesday:FCloudy and rather wet for
OL,13,FOrkney, the rain heavy at times.
OL,14,FGenerally drier and brighter for
OL,15,FShetland, but still with a little
OL,16,Flight rain at times.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
