OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FNortherly winds prevailing during this
OL,7,Fperiod bring rather cool conditions
OL,8,Fwith variable cloud amounts and a few
OL,9,Fscattered showers.
